From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bernardo Pereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:59:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Record inline margin offsets with the inline layout

Parley lays text out without the horizontal margins of the inline boxes it
runs through, so a non-replaced inline box's margins did nothing. The inline
layout now stores, per line, the inline-start offset of each item, and the
geometry walk adds it. The paint walk follows in the same change.
---
